OL,3,GNEWSAPreschool treasurer jailed for
OL,4,Astealing #29k
OL,5,
OL,6,FA debt-ridden treasurer who stole
OL,7,F#29,000 from her local preschool funds
OL,8,Fin north Devon has been jailed for
OL,9,Feight months.
OL,11,FExeter Crown Court heard Jenny
OL,12,FCannon-Smith began stealing from
OL,13,FBerrynarbour village preschool six
OL,14,Fmonths after taking up the role, and
OL,15,Fkept diverting money into her accounts
OL,16,Ffor a year.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
