OL,3,GNEWSAPreschool treasurer jailed for
OL,4,Astealing #29k
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe court was told the fraud nearly led
OL,7,Fto the school's closure, but the local
OL,8,Fcommunity raised enough money in a week
OL,9,Fto pay staff and keep it going, with
OL,10,Fone pupil selling his Pokemon cards to
OL,11,Fraise funds.
OL,13,FHowever Cannon-Smith's fraud meant tax
OL,14,Fhas not been paid, the court was told.
